源"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["国家市场监督管理总局 (2023). 药品经营和使用质量监督管理办法（总局令第 84 号）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.gov.cn/gongbao/2023/issue_10846/202311/content_6917322.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.gov.cn/gongbao/2023/issue_10846/202311/content_6917322.html"]},"；国家市场监督管理总局 (2022). 药品网络销售监督管理办法（总局令第 58 号，第八条至第十条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.gov.cn/gongbao/content/2022/content_5717002.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.gov.cn/gongbao/content/2022/content_5717002.htm"]},""]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["原书备注"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["法条可以逐字核对，但「按处方吃比自己买着吃能少出多少事」没人做过量化研究，所以按「难以量化」记 B 级。本节第 5、7 条说的类固醇和性激素，也走同一套规则。真到了该靠药减重的程度，医生会先看体重指数、身上有没有别的病、有没有不能用药的情况，再定吃不吃、吃哪种。这个判断是买不到的。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["我的备注"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["写下对自己有用的提醒…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/tip/28-05"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["上一条"]},"不要用合成代谢类固醇（「增肌针」「口服药」）来长肌肉"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link next","href":"/tip/28-07"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["下一条"]},"性激素类药只在医生开方并定期复查的前提下用，不要网购、不要自己加量"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"section","props":{"className":"life-tip-related"},"children":[{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["本主题的其他建议"]},{"tag":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/28-01"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["不要用极端节食、断食或催吐来控制体重，要减就从运动那一侧减"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["神经性厌食的人，死亡概率大约是同龄人的 5.9 倍。每 1000 个人跟一年，死 5.1 个。死的人里每五个有一个是自杀。而它的入口就是节食：跟踪 44 所中学…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/28-02"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["打针、埋线、开刀之前查两样：机构许可证上有没有「医疗美容」，动手的人是不是主诊医师"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["动针、动刀、用医疗器械，会破皮或进到身体里的，就算看病。只能在许可证上写了「医疗美容」的机构做，动手的必须是注册过的执业医师。在美容院、工作室、酒店房间里做属于…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/28-03"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["面部填充避开鼻背、眉间、额头这几个部位，更别为省钱找非正规注射"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["打填充针后失明的人里，一半多打的是鼻部，其次是眉间、额头和法令纹，八成多用的是玻尿酸。失明的人只有两成视力完全恢复，一成多部分恢复，将近两成还伤到了脑。目前没有…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/28-04"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["不要买承诺「快速瘦」的减肥药、减肥咖啡、瘦身糖果和酵素梅（号称泡过酵素的梅子）"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["这类产品里最常查出偷加的是西布曲明，它原来是减肥药，2010 年在中国被停掉了。有心脏病或糖尿病的超重的人吃了三年多，没致命的心梗高约三成，中风高约三成六。体重…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/28-08"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["如果「觉得自己丑」已经到反复照镜子、反复想改的程度，先做一次体像评估再谈手术"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["去做整形手术的人里约 15% 有躯体变形障碍，就是把别人基本看不出的缺陷放大到影响生活。去皮肤科求美的人里约 13%，两边都是七成多为女性。这种人做完一处又会盯…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/28-09"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["矫正牙齿要找有正畸资质的医生当面检查、按时复诊，别网购牙套自己在家戴"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["透明牙套在国内是二类医疗器械，说明书要求在有正畸资质的医生指导下戴、定期复诊。美国药监部门说没批准过不经牙医开方就直接卖给个人的牙套。没人当面检查，可能咬合变歪…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-text-link","href":"/book/28"},"children":["阅读整个主题：别为了外形把身体搞坏 ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"15","height":"15","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tabbar","aria-label":"主导航"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"","href":"/book"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"21","height":"21","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-book-open","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M12 7v14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["全书"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"","href":"/top-50"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"21","height":"21","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-star","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .9